; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 17. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'na4B_neil'
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05E8F7! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Long walk, but[N]everyone held up well.[WAI][N]This is the most famous of[N]the Nazca lines: the[N]condor. You've heard of[N]it, right?[WAI][N]No one knows why people[N]long ago made drawings[N]this enormous.[WAI][N]Even standing here, the[N]scale is hard to take in.[N]Why don't we split up and[N]look around for a while?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lily'
na4B_lily.dialogstring_05F0C8! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Awesome, aren't[N]they? The people from[N]ancient times. How could[N]they have drawn these…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lance'
na4B_lance.dialogstring_05EF2D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Study, play, hear[N]stories[AD] never thought[N]I'd live 'em.[FIN]Seth would've loved all[N]this.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_erik'
na4B_erik.dialogstring_05F278! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm scared for some[N]reason… I'll be close to[N]Neil.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_neil'
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05E9F0! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Ha ha ha. Don't rush[N]like that. Go sightseeing[N]with everyone first.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_kara'
na4B_kara.dialogstring_05EDA1! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: If you look at it[N]like this, it looks kind[N]of like the white lines on[N]a school playground on[N]track and field day.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Surprisingly, the ancient[N]Nazca people were doing[N]the 100-meter dash here,[N]weren't they?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lily'
na4B_lily.dialogstring_05F0FE! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Don't these stones[N]look a little too[N]carefully placed to be[N]natural?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_kara'
na4B_kara.dialogstring_05EE15! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This is exactly[N]where the condor's stomach[N]would be, isn't it?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Don't you think that if[N]you dig here, you'll find[N]eggs or something like[N]that?[FIN]I-I'm joking. (Laughs) I'm[N]not really going to search[N]for them.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_spirit'
na4B_spirit.dialogstring_05F349! `[BOR:8][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Mweheheheheheh…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_kara'
na4B_kara.dialogstring_05ED60! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: It probably feels[N]great to draw a huge[N]picture on a natural[N]canvas like this,[FIN]…being able to feel the[N]wind, having nothing else[N]to distract you.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_erik'
na4B_erik.dialogstring_05F29F! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: What's going to[N]happen…? I'm getting[N]excited.[END]`
na4B_erik.dialogstring_05F2C7! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: What's going to[N]happen…? I'm getting[N]excited.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_neil'
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EA25! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Aaallright, now that[N]everyone's back, let's get[N]to the main question.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]The thing that Will was[N]calling a Mystic Statue[N]is probably going to be[N]somewhere in this plain,[N]right?[FIN][CLD][PAU:28][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: The thought came to[N]me when I was looking at[N]the drawing on the ground[N]just now;[FIN]don't you think that you[N]can kind of see the form[N]of a swan in this condor[N]image?[FIN][CLD][PAU:14][BOR:D][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That's it…! You've[N]figured it out…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]We've been comparing the[N]arrangement of the stars[N]in that constellation to a[N]swan,[FIN]…but as far as the ancient[N]people of Nazca were[N]concerned, it might have[N]been a condor.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lily'
na4B_lily.dialogstring_05F148! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You guys! You guys![N]I've got it![END]`
na4B_lily.dialogstring_05F160! `[PAU:28][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Look! Look at the[N]stones on the ground![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]They're in the same places[N]as the stars in Cygnus![END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_neil'
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EB2E! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: [N]we'll talk about it when[N]everyone comes back.[FIN][::][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:0]Neil: That's it…![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:0]There are nine stars in[N]the constellation of[N]Cygnus, and there are also[N]nine stones…[FIN]`
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EB94! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](In that case, where would[N]the red star that we've[N]started seeing recently[N]be[AD]?)[FIN][PAL:0] The condor's head[N] The condor's right leg[N] The condor's left leg[N] The condor's tail[PAL:4]`
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EBE5! `[CLR]Will: No, wait. It should[N]be underneath the[N]constellation of Cygnus…[FIN]`
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EC0E! `[CLR]Will: That's it…! It would[N]be right in the joint of[N]the left leg![FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Alright…! Let's try[N]to examine that part of[N]the left leg![END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lily'
na4B_lily.dialogstring_05F1C3! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: A mystery hidden[N]in a constellation; it's[N]really romantic somehow,[N]isn't it?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_lance'
na4B_lance.dialogstring_05EF98! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ya think we're[N]solvin' somethin' that all[N]those explorers and[N]scholars missed[AD]?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_kara'
na4B_kara.dialogstring_05EE7C! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: My heart's[N]pounding[AD] I can't believe[N]we get to experience[N]something like this.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_neil'
na4B_neil.dialogstring_05EC5B! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I think things like[N]this are nice on occasion.[N]My heart is pounding like[N]when I'm inventing.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na4B_buried_tile'
na4B_buried_tile.dialogstring_05E6C0! `[DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]A strange tile lies buried[N]in the sand.[FIN][CLD][DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]When Will's flute touches[N]it, the ground begins to[N]roar![END]`
na4B_buried_tile.dialogstring_05E721! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Will[AD]! Stay back![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]We don't know what's[N]under there[AD]!![END]`
na4B_buried_tile.dialogstring_05E753! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3][DLY:0]Erik: Wah…! It looks like[N]something huge is[N]descending from above[N]us…!![END]`
na4B_buried_tile.dialogstring_05E774! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Aah…! Will…!![N]Will…!!![PAU:28][CLD]`
na4B_buried_tile.dialogstring_05E811! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Going off on my own[N]would be perfect[AD])[FIN](If I wanted to get lost[N]in a desert I don't know.)[END]`
